                        "form": "cultuelles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "162ada55-d684-31e6-940a-e0334a964ef1",
                        "entry_id": "c3904503-790a-3cdf-b47f-279e6b7c8c61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a trait au culte."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8e937ac-89ba-417a-840a-d1d5ee02c8ee",
                                "sense_id": "162ada55-d684-31e6-940a-e0334a964ef1",
                                "text": "Effrayé, le voisinage, craignant qu’un meurtre ne soit en train d’être commis dans le lieu cultuel, a immédiatement alerté la maréchaussée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf53c354-76e3-4a3b-8254-43957d18beb9",
                                "sense_id": "162ada55-d684-31e6-940a-e0334a964ef1",
                                "text": "C’est sous un ancien terrain de football de la commune, qui doit accueillir prochainement un hypermarché, que les chercheurs de l’Inrap ont découvert cet édifice cultuel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7385c957-4d18-461a-acd7-6799a3e205fb",
                                "sense_id": "162ada55-d684-31e6-940a-e0334a964ef1",
                                "text": "On définit alors comme isiaque le culte hors d’Égypte d’une douzaine de divinités appartenant à un même cercle mythique, cultuel et liturgique, originaires de la vallée du Nil, à savoir Horus, Hydreios, Isis, Osiris et Sarapis..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "929d6fdc-bcec-4596-b620-e90723a1bbb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3904503-790a-3cdf-b47f-279e6b7c8c61",
                        "source_sense_id": "162ada55-d684-31e6-940a-e0334a964ef1",
                        "target_lang_word": "cult",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cult",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc52fe07-4a81-36fe-977b-5500d85267c2",
                                        "entry_id": "6310610e-100c-3fcb-9ef4-6f254feea4ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The veneration, devotion, and religious rites given to a deity (especially in a historical polytheistic context), or (in a Christian context) to a saint; a subset of worship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8db10d2e-d7ec-4818-8637-44b642b8f6e6",
                                                "sense_id": "fc52fe07-4a81-36fe-977b-5500d85267c2",
                                                "text": "imperial cult"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "402b040a-ce4c-466e-a166-cd05162b001e",
                                                "sense_id": "fc52fe07-4a81-36fe-977b-5500d85267c2",
                                                "text": "the cult of Mary"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2a1b84f-6c3c-31fb-9f06-ff48b2a3582d",
                                        "entry_id": "6310610e-100c-3fcb-9ef4-6f254feea4ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of people having an obsession with or intense admiration for a particular activity, idea, person or thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86159e50-01d9-4cb7-954b-7d1859d99e71",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a1b84f-6c3c-31fb-9f06-ff48b2a3582d",
                                                "text": "the heavy metal cult"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77ee6c8e-0e06-49e7-97da-d4fbbe42f96d",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a1b84f-6c3c-31fb-9f06-ff48b2a3582d",
                                                "text": "the cult of basketball"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dacc0af9-f501-4af1-a9c8-c08a67f42e06",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a1b84f-6c3c-31fb-9f06-ff48b2a3582d",
                                                "text": "the guitarist's cult of loyal fans"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deb6f50a-8f86-4d5e-8c67-8c1c78abb84b",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a1b84f-6c3c-31fb-9f06-ff48b2a3582d",
                                                "text": "the cult of celebrity"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                        "entry_id": "6310610e-100c-3fcb-9ef4-6f254feea4ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group, sect or movement following an unorthodox religious or philosophical system of beliefs, especially one in which members remove and exclude themselves from greater society, including family members not part of the cult, and show extreme devotion to a charismatic leader."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c603f378-621b-403e-b8c0-2e551428afca",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "Two former cult members explain the difficulties they had extricating themselves from it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6762527c-67f9-4748-b093-c1bee247f0fd",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "Werner Erhard's highly successful est cult is partly derived from Scientology. Erhard had some experience with Scientology in 1969. Then he worked for a while in Mind Dynamics, itself an offshoot of Jose Silva's Mind Control."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48a4d5d1-6e56-43bf-9f92-5a29bd743d63",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "There are scores of modern religious cults and sects that have been influenced by Hinduism to varying degrees. Werner Erhard, founder of 'Landmark Education's 'The Forum',' and 'est' seminars, which have about 700,000 graduates, was influenced by Hinduism through Swami Muktananda, one of Erhard's principal gurus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb0a07aa-8973-4de1-9538-ef6850b76f02",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "Outsiders often criticize the extreme commitment of group members. But what is really happening is that leader and followers are conspiring to realize a vision that is falsified daily. For the cult is not paradise, and the leader is not God. Hence the follower is embattled; to squarely confront the many failings of the leader and the group is to call into question one's own great work. Only by daily recommitting himself can the follower continue to work toward his ultimate goal. Each follower works out a secret compromise, acknowledging some things while denying or distorting others. Clearly this is a high-risk strategy that may go awry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "943fe8e4-b942-4b4f-9906-2f84d649719b",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "The difference between a cult and an established religion is sometimes about one generation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e62c3ee-9f9f-4aea-b1ed-5e33b5c34689",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "If Jones' People's Temple wasn't a cult, then the term has no meaning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1c6a464-23ad-44d4-8143-e670ed27d953",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "Another potent element of the new cult milieu was the therapy sect, which offered believers the chance to achieve their full human potential through personal growth and self-actualization by taking total responsibility for one's actions. The prototypical movement of this kind was est (Erhard Seminar Training), in which intense and often grueling sessions forced followers to confront a new view of reality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cb2b41d-95dc-469f-8d65-5ad99f4f155b",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "He sounds like a cult leader about to demand his followers drink poison. And it frankly doesn’t help that he looks like Jim Jones to a genuinely creepy degree."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89cc5e03-c3cd-4b45-8b35-c0f91c9f9429",
                                                "sense_id": "ad60ff15-d542-3888-9ee3-370646c1ef91",
                                                "text": "Marc Andreessen, a venture capitalist who has become one of Silicon Valley's most outspoken opponents of regulation, has described people who warn of existential risks from AI as a cult, no different from other millenarian movements that warn of impending social disasters."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cult",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8854842a-6432-3d3e-aa39-7c2a42e35e90",
                                        "entry_id": "45f9faac-fe39-3da4-b1ac-137b33fb73eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to a cult."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "577a5dfc-1095-3214-a644-9545ae6b744a",
                                        "entry_id": "45f9faac-fe39-3da4-b1ac-137b33fb73eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Enjoyed by a small, loyal group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1af3196c-cc1b-4d26-9ee0-49640fc078c1",
                                                "sense_id": "577a5dfc-1095-3214-a644-9545ae6b744a",
                                                "text": "a cult horror movie"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcab1bfd-69e4-45b7-abd3-29400feb0248",
                                                "sense_id": "577a5dfc-1095-3214-a644-9545ae6b744a",
                                                "text": "To a certain extent, the cult movie and the classic are opposites, appealing to vastly different audiences. Whereas a film can become an instant cult, and then forgotten, a film cannot become an “instant classic”, which is only critical shorthand for “excellent”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55f43951-5139-4989-9298-b28c8726d236",
                                                "sense_id": "577a5dfc-1095-3214-a644-9545ae6b744a",
                                                "text": "Monte Hellman, whose terse action films, epitomized by the 1971 road movie “Two-Lane Blacktop,” made him a cult hero of the American independent film movement, died on Tuesday in Palm Desert, Calif."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b389f674-5b2d-3a70-ab81-30a9fe035d8b",
                                        "entry_id": "45f9faac-fe39-3da4-b1ac-137b33fb73eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of kvlt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "neologism",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f3da94e3-5d0d-4161-bc42-27ba91f657e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3904503-790a-3cdf-b47f-279e6b7c8c61",
